+        intent under nmap semantics) — deny-by-default is correct
+        there;
+      * domain-shaped tokens in path position are file references
+        ("python3 ws/probe.py"), never bare connection targets.
+    """
     targets: set = set()
     for m in _IP_RE.finditer(command):
         targets.add(m.group())
